  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Measure out and prepare all the ingredients. Set the Instant Pot to sautee, dice the tomatoes and serrano pepper.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-instant-pot-palak-paneer/#wprm-recipe-53933-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Instant-Pot-Palak-Paneer-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Put the butter in the Instant Pot along with the spices: cumin seeds, garam masala, ground coriander, paprika, and sea salt to taste.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-instant-pot-palak-paneer/#wprm-recipe-53933-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Instant-Pot-Palak-Paneer-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the serrano pepper, chopped onion, minced garlic, ginger, and diced tomatoes to the Instant Pot.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-instant-pot-palak-paneer/#wprm-recipe-53933-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Instant-Pot-Palak-Paneer-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the spinach and water. Turn the sautee function off, put the lid on, and set to manual, high pressure for 1 minute. Use quick release.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-instant-pot-palak-paneer/#wprm-recipe-53933-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Instant-Pot-Palak-Paneer-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Using an immersion blender, blend this to a paste.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-instant-pot-palak-paneer/#wprm-recipe-53933-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Instant-Pot-Palak-Paneer-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the paneer and set the Instant Pot to warm.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-instant-pot-palak-paneer/#wprm-recipe-53933-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Instant-Pot-Palak-Paneer-6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Rice the cauliflower by putting the cauliflower florets into a food processor.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-instant-pot-palak-paneer/#wprm-recipe-53933-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Instant-Pot-Palak-Paneer-7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a frying pan over medium heat, add the butter, cumin seeds, and garam masala.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-instant-pot-palak-paneer/#wprm-recipe-53933-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Instant-Pot-Palak-Paneer-8.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the riced cauliflower and stir to combine well.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-instant-pot-palak-paneer/#wprm-recipe-53933-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Instant-Pot-Palak-Paneer-9.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Put the seasoned cauliflower rice and palak paneer into bowls.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-instant-pot-palak-paneer/#wprm-recipe-53933-step-0-9",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Instant-Pot-Palak-Paneer-10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Plate and serve them together. Enjoy!",
